WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Discover presents one activity with time, cost, energy, Save, and Skip controls.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Details adds materials and practical steps in a native sheet with Save for later.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Saved keeps an idea locally so you can return to it after closing the app.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Preferences summarizes practical filters. Each row opens a selection list; Any includes every option.
